{"id":"2d8f5002c4256603","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-truth-predicate.md","title":"Truth Predicate","display":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-truth-predicate","aliases":["57-df-truth-predicate"],"display":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate","depends_on":["[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","[[57-df-maxcon]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-truth-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-truth-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-predicate — Truth Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e892c7a9bb01feb5\" href=\"?note=e892c7a9bb01feb5\" title=\"57-df-maxcon\">57-df-maxcon</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为固定语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> 为固定结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为固定单射编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为元层的一元关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}(n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}(n)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}\">\\(n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TrPred}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TrPred}_S\\)</span> 的环境参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,g\">\\(\\mathfrak A,g\\)</span> 固定不变；“真”指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> 中的句子满足关系，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>。若研究算术标准真，则令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\coloneqq\\{g(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\coloneqq\\{g(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}\\in\\mathrm{TrPred}_S\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(g(\\sigma)\\in\\mathrm{Tr}\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Tr}\\in\\mathrm{TrPred}_S\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(g(\\sigma)\\in\\mathrm{Tr}\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}(n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Tr}(n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该定义不要求 Tr 自身可在对象语言中定义，也不限制非句子码上的取值；可定义真谓词不存在的结论在相应 Tarski 定理中另行陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-maxcon","status":"resolved","id":"e892c7a9bb01feb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-maxcon]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-S-ar]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为固定语言，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ 为固定结构，$g:\\mathrm{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N$ 为固定单射编码。$\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为元层的一元关系，$\\mathrm{Tr}(n)$ 缩写 $n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}$。$\\mathrm{TrPred}_S$ 的环境参数 $\\mathfrak A,g$ 固定不变；“真”指 $\\mathfrak A$ 中的句子满足关系，见 [[57-df-satisfaction]]。若研究算术标准真，则令 $S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$、$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathrm{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TrPred}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}\\coloneqq\\{g(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\land\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}\\in\\mathrm{TrPred}_S\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Tr}\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\bigl(g(\\sigma)\\in\\mathrm{Tr}\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak A\\models\\sigma\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}(n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\mathrm{Tr}.","display":true}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"9880eab1adc3d630","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。"},{"id":"73eb4bf154d08499","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$S(\\mathbb N)$ 在 $S$ 上为每个 $n\\in\\mathbb N$ 加入互异新常量 $c_n$；$\\mathfrak N^+$ 将 $c_n$ 解释为 $n$。$\\mathrm{ElDiag}(\\mathbb N)$ 由下式在本文件定义；扩张语言保留原符号分区，仅添加零元函数符号 $c_n$。"},{"id":"04536d8a98748b81","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Definable}(R,\\mathfrak A)$ 是下式的元层可定义性谓词。"},{"id":"4a894c201e15cf14","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 取 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]] 的自然数集合类，$\\mathrm{Rec}$ 取 [[57-df-arith0]]。"},{"id":"536f78c4d1ada7bd","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S=S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$，$\\mathfrak A=\\mathfrak N$ 是 [[57-df-S-ar]] 的标准算术结构；$g$ 满足 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的 $\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$x$ 为固定变量，$\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathfrak A}=\\operatorname{TrueCode}_{\\mathfrak A,g}$ 取 [[57-df-truth-predicate]]；代入数码取 [[57-df-numeral]]。本文件 $\\